&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Recruiter, Engineering &amp;amp; GTM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Santa Clara, CA &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;(3-5 days/week onsite)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Orkes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orkes is building the modern workflow orchestration platform for distributed applications, helping engineering teams simplify complex systems, automate workflows, and build reliable cloud-native applications at scale. Built on the open-source Conductor project, we&#39;re growing rapidly and scaling a world-class engineering organization alongside our go-to-market teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt; to help us attract exceptional technical and commercial talent during our next stage of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our&amp;nbsp; Lead Technical Recruiter, you&#39;ll partner closely with our HR Manager and executive leadership to build the teams that will shape the future of Orkes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly strategic, hands-on recruiting role. You&#39;ll own full-cycle recruiting for technical and go-to-market hiring while helping establish scalable recruiting practices for a fast-growing startup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who loves sourcing difficult-to-find talent, understands competitive hiring markets, and enjoys partnering directly with hiring managers to build exceptional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Technical Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead full-cycle recruiting for Software Engineering, Platform Engineering, Cloud Infrastructure, Solutions Engineering, Product, and Technical Leadership roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit senior-level individual contributors, including Senior, Staff, and Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build pipelines for difficult-to-fill technical positions through proactive sourcing and networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support GTM Hiring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit for strategic Go-to-Market positions including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solutions Architects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Support Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Talent Pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proactive sourcing strategies rather than relying solely on inbound applicants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with passive candidates across engineering and enterprise software communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain healthy talent pipelines for future hiring needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Hiring Leaders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise hiring managers on market trends, compensation, and candidate availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run effective intake meetings and develop recruiting strategies for each search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive interview processes and deliver an exceptional candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve Recruiting Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage candidate pipelines and ATS workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve recruiting processes, reporting, and hiring efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with agencies when needed while prioritizing internally sourced talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish scalable recruiting best practices as the company grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of full-cycle technical recruiting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for venture-backed startups or high-growth SaaS companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success hiring Software Engineers, Platform Engineers, Infrastructure Engineers, and Engineering Leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting Go-to-Market talent, including Enterprise Account Executives and technical customer-facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sourcing expertise using LinkedIn Recruiter, GitHub, referrals, networking, and creative outbound strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring senior technical talent including Staff and Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and hiring manager partnership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of today&#39;s technical hiring landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting in cloud infrastructure, distributed systems, AI, developer tools, or enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting organizations scaling from early-stage startup through rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with engineering career leveling and technical interview processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re naturally curious and enjoy learning new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-paced startup environments where priorities evolve quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly organized and know how to manage multiple searches simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy partnering with hiring managers and influencing hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re passionate about finding exceptional talent before competitors do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You believe sourcing is a competitive advantage, not simply posting jobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Orkes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a rapidly growing developer-first infrastructure company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build world-class engineering and GTM organizations from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, high visibility, and significant career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, equity, and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
